---
description: Shared project rules and the hand-off between Cursor and Claude Code
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo is worked on with BOTH Cursor and Claude Code. The full rules are in
`AGENTS.md` – follow them. The most important part:

- **Start of every session:** run `./handoff.sh start` in the repo root (pulls
  the newest work from GitHub and prints `HANDOFF.md`), then read `HANDOFF.md`
  before doing anything else. It says where the last session stopped.
- **End of every session / after finishing a piece of work:** update
  `HANDOFF.md` (date, "by Cursor", what you did, next steps, open questions),
  add a line to `PROGRESS.md`, then run `./handoff.sh save "what you did"`
  (commits and pushes to GitHub, branch `claude/nice-bardeen-84bg5p`).
- The owner is a beginner: plain words, do the work yourself, and never make
  things up – say when you're not sure and ask for missing information.
- The app is in `eightcount/`. Never edit `EightCount.xcodeproj` (generated
  from `eightcount/project.yml` with `xcodegen generate`).
